        <div class="prose">
          <p>GPSRdocs fits companies that manufacture, import, or sell consumer products and need a clear way to manage product safety documents and gaps.</p>
          <ul class="who-list">
            <li><b>Product owners</b>See product-specific documents, risks, and open tasks in one view.</li>
            <li><b>Compliance</b>Can track documentation coverage and missing attachments systematically.</li>
            <li><b>Management</b>Gets the big picture of which product groups are ready and where work remains.</li>
